msgstr "Start ansigtsscanning"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Scan ansigtsmodel"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ansigtsmodellen kan ikke gemmes"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Scan anden model"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Kunne ikke optage den anden model"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Din første model er gemt, så ansigtslogin virker allerede. Sørg for, a"
"t dit ansigt er godt oplyst og centreret, og prøv igen – eller spring "
"over og tilføj en model senere fra Indstillinger."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Tilføj en ansigtsmodel (påkrævet)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Ansigtslogin kræver mindst én ansigtsmodel, så denne scanning kan ikke"
" springes over. Optag den i det lys, du normalt sidder i. Belysning æn"
"drer, hvordan dit ansigt ser ud for kameraet, så overvej senere at til"
"føje en anden model fra Indstillinger, optaget i et andet lys (for eks"
"empel lamper om aftenen i stedet for dagslys)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Tilføj en anden ansigtsmodel (anbefales)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Din første model er gemt. Belysning ændrer, hvordan dit ansigt ser ud "
"for kameraet: en model optaget i dagslys kan fejle om aftenen under la"
"mper (eller omvendt), og Ubuntu Hello løber så ind i en timeout i sted"
"et for at låse op. En anden model optaget i et andet lys holder genken"
"delsen pålidelig på alle tidspunkter af dagen."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Skift belysningen først: tænd eller sluk loftslyset eller skrivebordsl"
"ampen, vend dig væk fra vinduet, eller tag de briller på, du nogle gan"
"ge bruger. Se derefter lige ind i kameraet og tryk på Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Opsætning af Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan automatisk låse din {} op ved hjælp af ansigtsgodkend"
"else (registreret tegnebog: {}).\n\n<b>TPM-status:</b> Kontrollerer TP"
"M-hardware og -værktøjer..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan automatisk låse din {} op ved hjælp af ansigtsgodkend"
"else (registreret tegnebog: {}).\n\n<b>TPM-status:</b> TPM-hardware fu"
"ndet. Installerer <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatisk..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan automatisk låse din {} op ved hjælp af ansigtsgodkend"
"else (registreret tegnebog: {}).\n\n<b>TPM-status:</b> Hardware TPM 2."
"0 aktiv. Din adgangskode vil være sikkert forseglet inde i TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan automatisk låse din {} op ved hjælp af ansigtsgodkend"
"else (registreret tegnebog: {}).\n\n<b>TPM-status:</b> TPM-hardware fu"
"ndet, men automatisk installation af <i>tpm2-tools</i> mislykkedes. Kø"
"r <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falder tilbage til softwar"
"ebaseret legitimationscaching."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan automatisk låse din {} op ved hjælp af ansigtsgodkend"
"else (registreret tegnebog: {}).\n\n<b>TPM-status:</b> Ingen TPM-hardw"
"are fundet. Brug af softwarebaseret legitimationscaching (AES-256-GCM)"
"."

