"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Kun én ansigtsmodel er tilmeldt. Belysning ændrer, hvordan dit ansigt "
"ser ud til kameraet, så en enkelt model kan svigte om aftenen under la"
"mper (eller i dagslys). Tilføj en anden model optaget i andet lys for "
"at forblive pålidelig oplåsning på ethvert tidspunkt af dagen."

